Mission 
To provide functional, cost-effective, flexible learning which adds lifelong value 
to quality education for all who seek knowledge. 
Objectives 
In addition to the broad vision and mission statements, some of the major 
objectives of the Nation Open University of Nigeria are to; 
 Ensure equity and equality of opportunities in education generally but 
specifically in university education; 
 Provide wider access to education generally but specifically university 
education in Nigeria; 
 Enhance education for all and lifelong learning; 
 Entrench global learning culture; 
 Provide instructional resources via the intensive use of information and 
communication technology; 
 Provide flexible and quantitative education; and 
 Reduce the cost, inconveniences and hassles militating against easy access 
to education and its delivery.

